msgstr "Foderserverens svar er ikke et JSON objekt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer is too large."
msgstr "Fodringsserverens svar er for stort."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's certificate could not be checked."
msgstr "Foderserverens certifikat kunne ikke kontrolleres."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's cursor is not usable."
msgstr "Foderserverens markør kan ikke bruges."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's address sends it somewhere else too many times."
msgstr "Det sender den et andet sted for mange gange."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's answer is too large."
msgstr "Det er for stort."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's certificate could not be checked."
msgstr "Fodercertifikatet kunne ikke kontrolleres."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The file's size is missing."
msgstr "Filens størrelse mangler."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are approved to forward to +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Følgende brugere er godkendt til at sende til + %(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are prohibited from participating in +%(guild)s guild chat."
msgstr "Følgende brugere må ikke deltage i + %(guild)s guild chat."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are prohibited from participating in +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Følgende brugere må ikke deltage i + %(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild"
msgstr "Guild"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a category with that name."
msgstr "Guilden har allerede en kategori med det navn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a channel with that name."
msgstr "Guilden har allerede en kanal med det navn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a role with that name."
msgstr "Guild har allerede en rolle med det navn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild's own rules for what is written in its channels, on top of the site's word filter. Guildmasters are never held to them. A message that breaks one is refused with a short reason that never says which word."
msgstr "Guild 's egne regler for, hvad der er skrevet i dens kanaler, oven på stedet ord filter. Skyldige moderatorer bliver aldrig holdt for dem. Et budskab, der knækker en, afvises med en kort grund, der aldrig siger hvilket ord."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The host stays on stage."
msgstr "Værten bliver på scenen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The independent social platform"
msgstr "Den uafhængige sociale platform"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The internet gremlins have led you to a dark, musty dead-end. There's nothing here."
msgstr "Internet gremlins har ført dig til en mørk, must dead- end. Der er intet her."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The key that opens your messages in a new app. It is locked with your password and opened here, in this browser: %(site)s never sees it. Anyone with it and your account can read your chats, so never share it."
msgstr "Nøglen, der åbner dine beskeder i en ny app. Det er låst med din adgangskode og åbnet her, i denne browser: %(site)s aldrig ser det. Enhver med det og din konto kan læse dine chats, så aldrig dele det."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link `%(link)s` is not allowed. Reason: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Forbindelsen `%(link)s` er ikke tilladt. Begrundelse: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link `%(link)s` is not allowed. Reason: %(reason)s."
msgstr "Forbindelsen `%(link)s` er ikke tilladt. Begrundelse: %(reason)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The link can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Forbindelsen kan højst være %(num)s tegn."
msgstr[1] "Linket kan højst være %(num)s tegn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Linket kan ikke indeholde et brugernavn eller password."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Forbindelsen kan ikke indeholde mellemrum."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Forbindelsen skal starte med https: / / eller http://."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Forbindelsen har brug for en fuld adresse, såsom eksempel.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list is open to members so that anyone can see what the filter hides and why. Nothing on it is removed from the site: each member's own filter decides what they see."
msgstr "Listen er åben for medlemmer, så alle kan se, hvad filteret skjuler og hvorfor. Intet på det fjernes fra webstedet: hvert medlems eget filter bestemmer, hvad de ser."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list isn't shown on the Child filter"
msgstr "Listen vises ikke på børnefilteret"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coin every 30 days."
msgid_plural "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coins every 30 days."
msgstr[0] "Den mest en cirkel kan bede er %(num)s mønt hver 30 dage."
msgstr[1] "Den mest en cirkel kan bede er %(num)s mønter hver 30 dage."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The most voted posts of the last seven days."
msgstr "De mest stemte stillinger i de sidste syv dage."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The name %(host)s could not be found."
msgstr "Navnet %(host)s kunne ikke findes."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The newest of what they have done. Only the names of who they chat with are shown, never what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted."
msgstr "Det nyeste af det, de har gjort. Kun navnene på hvem de chatter med vises, aldrig hvad en chat siger: chats er end-to-end krypteret."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The numbers are always shown on your profile. This decides who can open each list and see the accounts on it. An account is only listed where its own setting allows it too."
msgstr "Tallene vises altid på din profil. Dette afgør, hvem der kan åbne hver liste og se regnskaberne på den. En konto er kun anført, hvor dens egen indstilling tillader det også."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The open-source platform for independent internet communities"
msgstr "Opensource-platformen for uafhængige internetsamfund"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The original content is not retained anywhere, including in this history."
msgstr "Det oprindelige indhold er ikke bevaret nogen steder, herunder i denne historie."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The other authors of a shared draft removed you as an author. What you wrote stays credited to you."
msgstr "De andre forfattere til et fælles udkast fjernet dig som forfatter. Hvad du skrev forbliver krediteret dig."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner deletes a channel instead of leaving it."
msgstr "Ejeren sletter en kanal i stedet for at forlade den."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner's role can't be changed."
msgstr "Ejerens rolle kan ikke ændres."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The page's current text isn't shown here; what you save replaces it."
msgstr "Sidens nuværende tekst vises ikke her; hvad du gemmer erstatter den."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture could not be stored. Try again later."
msgstr "Billedet kunne ikke lagres. Prøv igen senere."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture goes to your own linked storage, not to this site. You can add a few words under it."
msgstr "Billedet går til din egen forbundne opbevaring, ikke til dette websted. Du kan tilføje et par ord under det."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture you chose"
msgstr "Billedet du valgte"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post appears on the profile of whoever publishes it first. Optionally forward it into guilds for community discussion: each guild gets its own independent copy with its own votes and comments. Guilds are forwarded to when the draft is first published."
msgstr "Indlægget vises på profilen af den, der udgiver det først. Hvis man ønsker at overføre det til guilds til samfundsdiskussioner, får hver guild sin egen uafhængige kopi med sine egne stemmer og kommentarer. Guilds sendes til, når udkastet offentliggøres første gang."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post carries your name and is listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your name."
msgstr "Posten bærer dit navn og er anført på din profil. Stemmer, kommentarer og forwards deles med forfatteren, som redigerer og sletter det. Du kan træde af til enhver tid: posten bliver, uden dit navn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post refused the change."
msgstr "Stillingen afviste ændringen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The promo code `%(code)s` is not currently valid. Please begin a new transaction."
msgstr "Promo koden `%(code)s` er ikke gyldig i øjeblikket. Begynd en ny transaktion."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The proposal for @%(name)s has been withdrawn."
msgstr "Forslaget om @ %(name)s er trukket tilbage."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was deleted."
msgstr "Rollen %(role)s blev slettet."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was made."
msgstr "Rollen %(role)s blev lavet."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was saved."
msgstr "Rollen %(role)s blev reddet."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The royal bank has told us that you owe them some coin. You'll need to pay off your debts before you can continue."
msgstr "Den kongelige bank har fortalt os, at du skylder dem penge. Du skal betale din gæld, før du kan fortsætte."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules"
msgstr "Reglerne"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules below"
msgstr "Nedenstående regler"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The rules can be at most %(count)s character."
msgid_plural "The rules can be at most %(count)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Reglerne kan højst være %(count)s karakter."
msgstr[1] "Reglerne kan højst være %(count)s tegn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules can't contain control or invisible characters."
msgstr "Reglerne kan ikke indeholde kontrol eller usynlige tegn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The screenshot you are sending"
msgstr "Skærmbilledet du sender"

#. %(status)s is an HTTP status code
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answered %(status)s."
msgstr "Serveren svarede %(status)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answers with the posts to show and their order; %(site)s still hides anything a viewer may not see, and tells the server nothing about who is looking. Everyone is told that an outside server ranks this curation."
msgstr "Serveren svarer med de indlæg til at vise og deres rækkefølge; %(site)s stadig skjuler noget en fremviser kan ikke se, og fortæller serveren intet om, hvem der leder. Alle får at vide, at en ekstern server rangerer dette kuraterede feed."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server named %(num)s post; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgid_plural "The server named %(num)s posts; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgstr[0] "Serveren kaldet %(num)s indlæg; du kan se %(seen)s af dem."
msgstr[1] "Serveren hedder %(num)s indlæg; du kan se %(seen)s af dem."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The server thinks you're asking something silly. It might take you more seriously if you take off the jester outfit."
msgstr "Serveren tror, du beder om noget dumt. Det kan tage dig mere alvorligt, hvis du tager jostertøjet af."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site refused the bot's session."
msgstr "Stedet nægtede bot 's session."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site's admins marked this guild sensitive, so only an admin can change this."
msgstr "Hjemmesiden admins markeret denne guild følsomme, så kun en admin kan ændre dette."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The stage is full (%(num)s person)."
msgid_plural "The stage is full (%(num)s people)."
msgstr[0] "Scenen er fuld (%(num)s person)."
msgstr[1] "Scenen er fuld (%(num)s personer)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The storage service is not answering right now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Lageret svarer ikke lige nu. Prøv igen om et øjeblik."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The summary can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The summary can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Resuméet kan højst være %(num)s tegn."
msgstr[1] "Sammendraget kan højst være %(num)s tegn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The summary can be changed while the Space is live."
msgstr "Resuméet kan ændres, mens rummet er levende."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text isn't shown: this was removed by the site's administrators."
msgstr "Teksten er ikke vist: dette blev fjernet af webstedets administratorer."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text of this version was hidden by a site administrator."
msgstr "Teksten til denne version blev skjult af en site administrator."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time before links must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Tiden før links skal være et helt antal dage, 0 til %(max)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time in the guild must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Tiden i guild skal være et helt antal dage, 0 til %(max)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The title can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The title can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Titlen kan højst være %(num)s tegn."
msgstr[1] "Titlen kan højst være %(num)s tegn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The two revisions have the same text."
msgstr "De to revisioner har samme tekst."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your Google Drive. Try again."
msgstr "Uplottet ankom ikke i din Google Drive. Prøv igen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your OneDrive. Try again."
msgstr "Uplottet ankom ikke i din OneDrive. Prøv igen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive. Try again."
msgstr "Uplottet kom ikke. Prøv igen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The username @%(name)s has been pre-emptively reserved for: %(who)s"
msgstr "Brugernavnet @ %(name)s er forhåndsreserveret til: %(who)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The usual order - everything from the guilds and accounts you add"
msgstr "Den sædvanlige rækkefølge - alt fra guilds og konti du tilføjer"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading to Dailymotion. Add it again."
msgstr "Videoen er ikke færdig med at uploade til Dailymotion. Tilføj det igen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading. Add it again."
msgstr "Videoen er ikke færdig med uploading. Tilføj det igen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The website can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The website can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Hjemmesiden kan højst være %(num)s tegn."
msgstr[1] "Hjemmesiden kan højst være %(num)s tegn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Hjemmesiden kan ikke indeholde et brugernavn eller password."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Hjemmesiden kan ikke indeholde mellemrum."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Webstedet skal starte med https: / / or http://."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Hjemmesiden har brug for en fuld adresse, såsom example.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The whole site <span class=\"text-muted\">(needs an age limit of a month or less)</span>"
msgstr "Hele stedet <span class=\"text-muted\">(har brug for en aldersgrænse på en måned eller derunder)</span>"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki is off: only guildmasters see it."
msgstr "Wikien er slukket: Kun de guild moderatorer se det."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki's first page can be emptied but not deleted."
msgstr "Wikiens første side kan tømmes, men ikke slettes."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The word filter has no words at the moment."
msgstr "Ordet filter har ingen ord i øjeblikket."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The words for other languages are adapted from %(source)s (%(licence)s): words that are also ordinary, innocent words were left out."
msgstr "Ordene for andre sprog er tilpasset fra %(source)s (%(licence)s): ord, der også er almindelige, uskyldige ord blev udeladt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The working copy as it is now. Only its authors can see this until it's published."
msgstr "Den arbejdskopi, som den er nu. Kun forfatterne kan se dette, indtil det er offentliggjort."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Theater"
msgstr "Teater"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their commenting history will show here."
msgstr "Deres kommentar historie vil vise her."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their forwarding activity will show here."
msgstr "Deres videresendelse vil vise her."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posting history will show here."
msgstr "Deres udstationering historie vil vise her."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posts and comments are left out of your feeds and threads and they cannot notify you. They are not told, and they can still follow you, comment on your posts and message you. Their anonymous posts and comments are not hidden, as hiding only those would tell you who wrote them. Mute someone from the menu on any of their posts or comments, or from their profile."
msgstr "Deres indlæg og kommentarer er udeladt fra dine feeds og tråde, og de kan ikke underrette dig. De får ikke at vide, og de kan stadig følge dig, kommentere dine indlæg og sende dig besked. Deres anonyme indlæg og kommentarer er ikke skjult, som skjule kun dem, der ville fortælle dig, hvem der skrev dem. Mute nogen fra menuen på nogen af deres indlæg eller kommentarer, eller fra deres profil."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no approved users"
msgstr "Der er ingen godkendte brugere"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no exiled users"
msgstr "Der er ingen eksilbrugere"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmaster invitations."
msgstr "Der er ingen guild moderator invitationer."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmasters."
msgstr "Der er ingen guild moderatorer."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no posts here."
msgstr "Der er ingen poster her."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "There is no account named @%(name)s."
msgstr "Der er ingen konto ved navn @ %(name)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There is nothing to save yet."
msgstr "Der er intet at redde endnu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There was a problem. Please try again."
msgstr "Der var et problem. Prøv igen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no names in that file."
msgstr "Der var ingen navne i den fil."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no survivors."
msgstr "Der var ingen overlevende."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's a shortage of perfect request entities in this world. Would be a pity to damage yours."
msgstr "Der er mangel på perfekte eftersøgningsenheder i denne verden. Det ville være synd at skade dig."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's already an open proposal like this one."
msgstr "Der er allerede et åbent forslag som dette."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no account with that name."
msgstr "Der er ingen konto med det navn."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no invitation to speak."
msgstr "Der er ingen invitation til at tale."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There's no recovery code to keep yet."
msgstr "Der er ingen gendannelseskode endnu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing here right now."
msgstr "Der er intet her lige nu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing left here but a giant smouldering crater."
msgstr "Der er kun et kæmpe ulmende krater tilbage."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These are the users you are subscribed to."
msgstr "Det er de brugere, du er tilmeldt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These counts start from the day guild insights were switched on: before that the site did not record when people left a guild or how often its page was opened."
msgstr "Disse tællinger starter fra dagen guild indsigter blev tændt: før at webstedet ikke registrere, når folk forlod en guild, eller hvor ofte dens side blev åbnet."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These filters are saved as your default"
msgstr "Disse filtre gemmes som din standard"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These topics"
msgstr "Disse emner"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These users have been invited to moderate +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Disse brugere er blevet inviteret til moderat + %(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They already have this role."
msgstr "De har allerede denne rolle."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are 18 or over, so they can make their own account."
msgstr "De er 18 eller derover, så de kan gøre deres egen konto."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are already in this circle."
msgstr "De er allerede i denne cirkel."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are not told. Anyone you block leaves your circles."
msgstr "Det får de ikke at vide. Dem, du blokerer, forlader dine cirkler."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They are signed out everywhere, chat apps included. If they use chat, they may need their recovery code, or a browser where they've used chat, to read their old messages."
msgstr "De er afbrudt overalt, chat apps inkluderet. Hvis de bruger chat, kan de have brug for deres opsving kode, eller en browser, hvor de har brugt chat, til at læse deres gamle beskeder."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "They aren't in %(circle)s."
msgstr "De er ikke i %(circle)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't in this group."
msgstr "De er ikke i denne gruppe."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't muted here."
msgstr "De er ikke lammet her."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They asked you to turn Private posting off."
msgstr "De bad dig slukke for privat udstationering."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can buy and spend coins, tip, buy Premium and join or run paid circles."
msgstr "De kan købe og bruge mønter, tip, købe Premium og deltage eller køre betalte cirkler."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can comment."
msgstr "De kan kommentere."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can host and join Spaces and run live threads. Voice calls in a Space also need Chat to be on."
msgstr "De kan være vært og slutte sig til Spaces og køre live tråde. Stemmeopkald i et rum har også brug for chat at være på."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can make posts."
msgstr "De kan lave indlæg."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can message people, join group chats and make calls. The site never shows you what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted. Whoever knows their password can still sign in and read them."
msgstr "De kan sende beskeder til folk, deltage i gruppesnak og ringe. Webstedet viser dig aldrig, hvad en chat siger: chats er ende- to- end krypteret. Den, der kender deres adgangskode, kan stadig logge ind og læse dem."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can post anonymously and start a guild. You can still see who wrote an anonymous post."
msgstr "De kan skrive anonymt og starte en guild. Man kan stadig se, hvem der skrev et anonymt indlæg."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can see what you do on the site: your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported, and your recent sign-ins. The site never shows them what your chats say, because chats are end-to-end encrypted. But anyone who knows your password, a parent who chose it included, can sign in as you: change it in Security so that only you know it. They choose which of these are on for your account:"
msgstr "De kan se, hvad du gør på webstedet: dine indlæg, kommentarer, stemmer, bogmærker, følger, guilds, hvem du chatter med, at din konto blev rapporteret, og dine seneste signs. Webstedet viser dem aldrig, hvad dine chats siger, fordi chats er ende- to- end krypteret. Men enhver, der kender din adgangskode, en forælder, der valgte det inkluderet, kan logge ind som dig: ændre det i Sikkerhed, så kun du ved det. De vælger hvilken af disse der er på din konto:"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can't comment on your posts or comments, chat with you or notify you by mentioning you. They are not told, but they may work it out if they try to comment on something of yours."
msgstr "De kan ikke kommentere dine indlæg eller kommentarer, chatte med dig eller underrette dig ved at nævne dig. De får ikke at vide, men de kan finde ud af det, hvis de forsøger at kommentere noget af Deres."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They don't have this role."
msgstr "De har ikke denne rolle."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They go straight to your coin balance."
msgstr "De går direkte til din møntbalance."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They haven't asked for that."
msgstr "Det har de ikke bedt om."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They need to be in the guild, and not exiled from it."
msgstr "De skal være i guild, og ikke forvist fra det."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They need to join the channel first."
msgstr "De skal først ind i kanalen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They say they are 18 or over and asked you to release their account. If you do, it becomes their own and you can no longer see it."
msgstr "De siger, de er 18 eller derover og bad dig frigive deres konto. Hvis du gør, bliver det deres egen, og du kan ikke længere se det."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They're already a helper."
msgstr "De er allerede en hjælper."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They're already on stage."
msgstr "De er allerede på scenen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They've already been invited to speak."
