#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian has turned this off for your account."
msgstr "Din forælder eller værge har slået det fra for din konto."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian made this account for you. They can see what you do on the site (your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported and your recent sign-ins; the site never shows them what your chats say) and they choose which features are on. You can see which in [Settings > Content](/settings/content). They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it, because anyone who knows it can sign in as you and read your chats."
msgstr "Din forælder eller værge har lavet denne konto til dig. De kan se, hvad du gør på webstedet (dine indlæg, kommentarer, stemmer, bogmærker, følger, guilds, hvem du chatter med, at din konto blev rapporteret og dine seneste signs; webstedet viser dem aldrig, hvad dine chats siger), og de vælger, hvilke funktioner er på. Du kan se hvilke i [Indstillinger > Indhold] (/settings/content). De valgte din adgangskode: ændre det i [Indstillinger > Sikkerhed] (/settings/security), så kun du ved det, fordi alle, der kender det kan logge ind som du og læse dine chats."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your parent or guardian set a new password for your account and you were signed out. Sign in with the new password, then change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it."
msgstr "Din forælder eller værge satte en ny adgangskode til din konto, og du blev afbrudt. Log ind med den nye adgangskode, derefter ændre det i [Indstillinger > Sikkerhed] (/settings/security), så kun du kender det."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian stopped managing your account. It keeps the child lock until you confirm your age in Settings > Content. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr "Din forælder eller værge stoppede med at administrere din konto. Det holder barnet låst indtil du bekræfter din alder i Indstillinger > Indhold. De valgte din adgangskode: ændre den i [Indstillinger > Sikkerhed] (/settings/security), eller de kan stadig logge på som dig."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian turned Private posting off for your account."
msgstr "Din forælder eller værge slået Privat udstationering off for din konto."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian wants Private posting to stay on."
msgstr "Din forælder eller værge ønsker Privat udstationering at bo på."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian's account was suspended, so yours is suspended until theirs is back."
msgstr "Din forælder eller værge konto blev suspenderet, så din er suspenderet indtil deres er tilbage."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password"
msgstr "Din adgangskode"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your password has been changed. Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Dit kodeord er blevet ændret. Dine andre enheder er blevet afbrudt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password meets the requirements."
msgstr "Din adgangskode opfylder kravene."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your payouts"
msgstr "Dine udbetalinger"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone approved this. Only continue if this is your account."
msgstr "Din telefon godkendte det her. Fortsæt kun, hvis det er din konto."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone said no, so nobody was signed in."
msgstr "Din telefon sagde nej, så ingen blev logget ind."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your post is listed on your profile either way. Choose My profile to have its comments there too, and add guilds to post it straight into them: each guild gets its own copy with its own votes and comments."
msgstr "Dit indlæg er opført på din profil uanset hvad. Vælg Min profil er også at få sine kommentarer der, og tilføje guilds til at sende det direkte ind i dem: hver guild får sin egen kopi med sine egne stemmer og kommentarer."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your post will be taken off your profile, feeds and guilds. The site keeps a private copy for 90 days, which only you and the site's administrators can open. This can't be undone."
msgstr "Din post vil blive taget af din profil, feeds og guilds. Webstedet holder en privat kopi i 90 dage, som kun du og webstedets administratorer kan åbne. Det kan ikke gøres om."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posting history will show here."
msgstr "Din udstationering historie vil vise her."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts are kept out of All."
msgstr "Dine stillinger er holdt ude af All."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts can appear in All."
msgstr "Dine indlæg kan vises i All."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts from the last 28 days, with what each got (a post and its guild forwards added up). Only you can see this; these are counts, never names."
msgstr "Dine indlæg fra de sidste 28 dage, med hvad hver fik (et indlæg og dens guild fremad tilføjet). Kun du kan se dette; disse er tæller, aldrig navne."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts stay on your profile and in the feeds of people who follow you, but All leaves them out. Copies you forward to a guild follow that guild's own setting, and anonymous posts always appear in All, so nobody can tell which ones are yours."
msgstr "Dine indlæg forbliver på din profil og i feeds af folk, der følger dig, men alle udelader dem. Kopierer dig frem til en guild følge denne guild egen indstilling, og anonyme stillinger altid vises i All, så ingen kan se, hvilke der er dine."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "Din profil"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile details have been updated."
msgstr "Dine profiloplysninger er blevet opdateret."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your purchase was successful. A receipt will be emailed to you from Paypal."
msgstr "Dit køb var vellykket. En kvittering vil blive sendt til dig fra Paypal."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your roles"
msgstr "Dine roller"

#. a notification. %(title)s is the post's title; %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"%(title)s\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Dit planlagte indlæg \"%(title)s\" kunne ikke offentliggøres: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Det gemmes i dine udkast, så du kan løse det og skrive det eller planlægge det igen."

#. a notification about a post with no title. %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"Untitled\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Din planlagte indlæg \"Unavngivet\" kunne ikke offentliggøres: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Det gemmes i dine udkast, så du kan løse det og skrive det eller planlægge det igen."

