#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your siege failed. One of the guildmasters created or edited a comment in +%(guild)s within the last 60 days. You may try again in 7 days."
msgstr "Dit overtagelseskrav mislykkedes. En af de guild moderatorer oprettet eller redigeret en kommentar i + %(guild)s inden for de sidste 60 dage. Du kan prøve igen om 7 dage."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your siege failed. One of the guildmasters had a post forwarded to +%(guild)s, or edited one there, within the last 60 days. You may try again in 7 days."
msgstr "Dit overtagelseskrav mislykkedes. En af de guild moderatorer havde en post sendt til + %(guild)s, eller redigeret en der, inden for de sidste 60 dage. Du kan prøve igen om 7 dage."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your siege failed. One of the guildmasters has performed a mod action in +%(guild)s within the last 60 days. You may try again in 7 days."
msgstr "Dit overtagelseskrav mislykkedes. En af de guild moderatorer har udført en moderator handling i + %(guild)s inden for de sidste 60 dage. Du kan prøve igen om 7 dage."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your story is up for 24 hours."
msgstr "Din historie er oppe i 24 timer."

