#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your subscription will renew again."
msgstr "Dit abonnement vil blive fornyet igen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your subscription won't renew. You keep access until the day you paid to."
msgstr "Dit abonnement vil ikke forny sig. Du har adgang indtil den dag, du betalte til."

#, machine, plain1
